member Esquibel thanked the City Treasurer and staff
18.
CONTRACT MODIFICATIONS:
a)
Contract Modification #1 to Contract #7633 between the City of Cheyenne and
Laramie County Community College for the CDL “Your Tmck” Training Program.
(Various City Funds)
Mr. Moody moved to approve, seconded by Mr. Esquibel.
Motion carried by unanimous voice
vote.
Vieki Nemeeek, Public Works Director, provided a staff report and committee members Esquibel
and Moody commented on the item.
b)
Contract Modification #1 to Contract #7955 between the City of Cheyenne and
Trihydro Corporation for Landfill Mapping and Survey Services. (Solid Waste
Fund)
Mr. Esquibel moved to approve in an amount not to exceed 549,008.00, seconded by Mr. Moody.
Motion carried by unanimous voice vote.
Sam Quattrini, Landfill Manager, provided a staff report and committee member Roybal
commented on the item.
19.
CONSIDERATION OF BIDS/PURCHASES/REQUESTS FOR PROPOSALS:
d)
Consideration of Bid #E-I6-25 for furnishing a 2000 Gallon Single Axle Oil
Distributor Truck for the City of Cheyenne. Street & Alley Division. (2023-2026
Optional 1% Sales Tax)
Mr. Esquibel moved to accept the bid from Floyd’s Truck Center, Inc., Cheyenne. Wyoming. in
an amount not to exceed 5307,36 1.75, seconded by Mr. Moody.
Motion carried by unanimous
voice vote.
Vicki Nemeeek. Public Works Director, provided a staff report.
