amount not to exceed $416,227.70, seconded by Mr. Roybal. Motion carried by unanimous voice
vote.
Vicki Nemecek. Public Works Director, provided a staff report and Ti Barttelbort. Purchasing
Manager, provided additional infomrntion. Committee members Moody and Roybal commented
on the item.
f)
Consideration of Bid #E-l8-25 for furnishing a 30 Yard Rolloff Truck for the City
of Cheyenne, Sanitation Division. (Solid Waste Fund)
Mr. Roybal moved to accept the bid from Floyd’s Truck Center, Inc., Cheyenne, Wyoming, in an
